Dear Prof. Grant,

On behalf of the Organizing Committee, I am delighted to invite you to deliver a keynote address at the upcoming 2026 International Bioscience Summit, scheduled for April 14-16 in Geneva.

Your recent pioneering work in genetic sequence modeling has resonated across our academic community. We would be honored to host you for a 45-minute plenary lecture followed by an interactive panel discussion.

All travel arrangements, hotel accommodations, and conference registrations will be fully covered by the summit foundation.

Please let us know your availability by the end of next week.

Warm regards,

Dr. Evelyn Reed
Chair, Organizing Committee
